{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30ad54fe0af36cc9bd820180fc1fdd2eb7aea63c2b52fdf6bcd04ff78cabd832", "ja": "（前の打ち合わせが長引いてしまったな……。\n律子のPV撮影は順調に進んでるだろうか）", "zh": "（之前的会议拖得有点久了……\n律子的PV拍摄，不知道进行得还顺不顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "cdb95f800256372a4a7ba288de6ff286118a5b1e5d8602ab1770f00cbc875054", "ja": "「わ、私のことを見つめて……」\n……うーん、これじゃさっきと変わらないわね……。", "zh": "“请、请看着我……”\n……唔——这样跟刚才也没什么区别啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aba73085dc56f12febe67bec4408fb3898c606ab8f2e6c6c931b6ab39ee7e6af", "ja": "お、いたいた。律子、お疲れ様！", "zh": "哦，找到了。律子，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "9ac5e9681bf7abe481919d1f62c401189dcc2bba2359c5d6f084fc6ba5db261e", "ja": "わっ、{$P$}！？\nいつ来てたんですか！？", "zh": "哇，{$P$}！？\n您是什么时候来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bac246f343a36d20d0a3f6c2fef561a7bbd9d53dd8f96359201370159ca5d16e", "ja": "今来たばかりだけど……\nそこまで驚かなくてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我刚来不久……\n也不用这么惊讶吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "6918753c5bacda30f2d4b3617e0e8325c897acbcacddbe538664898f4874bcde", "ja": "た、タイミングってものがあるじゃないですか！\nまったく、ほんとに……！", "zh": "总、总要讲究时机的吧！\n真是的，真是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4ccaad6e5b72d6e4a256ad5dee39a5b1d4357b6c39b7cd1d7b17f01af7811d49", "ja": "そ、そんなにまずかったかな。ごめんな。\nえーと……それで、撮影はうまくいってるのか？", "zh": "是、是有点太糟了吗？抱歉啊。\n那个……所以，拍摄还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "094664f58195de67f57492bd502055d864434f6e8e69fff4e7c2a0d4037fab28", "ja": "それが、あんまり順調とは言えないですね……。\nちょっとNGが続いてるシーンがあって。", "zh": "这个嘛，实在不能说进展得很顺利……\n有个场景一直在NG。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "9b7ce7f2dfad1dc8200625c5d8adac7879b8925c2811df1397d821f1287892d5", "ja": "……恋心を表現するところが、\nどうしてもぎこちないと言われてしまったんです。", "zh": "……被说表现恋爱心情的地方，\n无论如何都显得很僵硬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "851dbee57d219ab793ec2a8ff1b31da5b050c933ac1653c5f02f53cd76c67e6c", "ja": "そうだったのか。うーん……一度一緒に練習でもして\nみるか？　相手役がいると何か変わるかもしれないし。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。嗯……要不要先一起练习一下？有个对手戏的对象，说不定会有所改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "a5996615b540853afa2d9379d7bec9bb0e4e643a35762da4b2763058f9f7c263", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}を相手役に？　ふむ。\nなるほど、確かによさそうですね。やってみましょ……", "zh": "诶，让{$P$}来当对手戏演员？嗯。\n原来如此，确实不错呢。试试看吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1011_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "5c68625e4b5af73f436139b5ed148cacb215d79230e4ab5f32ca1b0c5cd871ff", "ja": "秋月さん、撮影再開しまーす！", "zh": "秋月小姐，马上重新开始拍摄——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "410a531bd2739c25067cbe5273e0d11965f3b6d3a1209f27aa4f77f664cf9b82", "ja": "あ、はーい！　{$P$}、ありがとう\nございます。とりあえず、やるだけやってきます！", "zh": "啊，好——！{$P$}，谢谢您。总之，我先尽力去做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2e865623650247759312a2c0a2807e2966acf8c8fb8ef23b2e4177ab8169b480", "ja": "……なんだか、今ならできそうな気もするので。", "zh": "……总觉得，现在的话我好像也能做得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1014_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "8d025381bc52ba90e381bc99c8addd6e85f70d568621dfde6ad67874a0a58270", "ja": "はい、OKです！", "zh": "好的，没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "99d5702b206c6cd83c5f8b61a73730d3ca367bd27b4b70aa33cce0c82a882990", "ja": "律子、すごいじゃないか！　感情がしっかり伝わって\nきたよ。NG続きだったなんて信じられないな。", "zh": "律子，太厉害了！感情非常充分地传达\n过来了哦。真不敢相信刚才居然一直在NG呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "6fe93505e179c769a4e20f52345fdac2eb8d88dc62c2cccba7b989bf5d7bef11", "ja": "ふふっ♪　ありがとうございます！　でも、今うまく\nいったのは、{$P$}のおかげですよ？", "zh": "呵呵♪谢谢您！不过这次能顺利完成，多亏了{$P$}哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0ea845dd0f3d01296166e237d5a35fdb63ef209a56ecb0634054867331e5fa87", "ja": "そうなのか？　結局、練習も付き合えなかったし、\n特に何もしてない気がするんだが……。", "zh": "是这样吗？说到底，我连陪你练习都没做到，总觉得自己好像什么都没做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "93c8fab155c1383218970df360c85d56f5d5585826c5a16d41889d4de4bef939", "ja": "いえ、具体的な人物を想定することで、気持ちに\nリアリティが出て……って、え、リアリティ……？", "zh": "不是的。通过设想具体的人物，情感会更真实……呃，真实……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1019_p", "source_sha256": "322a363030d20e3caf7b882f5c6d9a32417a5debbd18078546a56cfc6f5b92a9", "ja": "律子？", "zh": "律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "1d3a3c74ae3b6d3489dbc98ef8f6b2cd8cfb50e0da5e112178ac2d0083b32f8d", "ja": "何でもないです！　……あっ、次のシーンの撮影が\n始まるみたいなので、行ってきますね！？", "zh": "没什么！……啊，好像要开始拍下一幕了，我先过去了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0324_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5ac2c8034bd5b175aaacd7e51c65bc8e8bba67bc3d50f55a24ca75d83ae3afef", "ja": "（……撮影がスムーズにいったようでなによりだ。\nPVの完成が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（……拍摄能顺利进行真是太好了。真期待PV完成啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
